  "instructions": [
    "Heat sesame oil in a large cazuela over medium-high heat.",
    "Add sliced ginger and cook for 1 minute, until fragrant.",
    "Add chopped garlic and cook for another minute, until softened.",
    "Add sliced shiitake mushrooms and cook until they release their liquid and start to brown, about 3-4 minutes.",
    "Add chopped gai lan and cook until wilted, about 2-3 minutes.",
    "Add nuka-pickle, almond milk, soy sauce, and sugar to the cazuela. Stir to combine.",
    "Bring the mixture to a simmer and cook for 5-7 minutes, until slightly thickened.",
    "Season with black pepper to taste.",
    "Garnish with chopped green onions and serve hot.",
    "Serve immediately and enjoy!"
  ],
